# Project todos (mandatory)

Canonical list: `.cursor/project-todos.md`

## Two sections — do not mix

- **Build next** = the real todo backlog (only what the user picked as important).
- **Feature triage (1–74)** = catalog of ✅/🔴/⚪ only. Never append new feature numbers there; if something new matters, add it under **Build next**.

## Every session

1. **Read** `.cursor/project-todos.md` early when starting work (or when the user asks status / what’s next).
2. **Update the file** in the same turn when you:
   - finish a Build next item → mark done
   - start focused work → mark doing
   - user asks to track something → add under **Build next** (or Ops / Later), not into triage 1–74
   - user drops an idea → mark dropped or remove
3. Do **not** rely only on chat `TodoWrite` for project-lasting work — that dies with the session.
4. Keep the file concise. No essays. One line per item when possible.
5. Never invent large backlogs the user did not ask to track.
